{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 2194 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "6f04101875abf15c41aa4027dc7eb2a52d890cda5c8f8cfa0b4b563476e3dc5a" :edb/db-before-t 2193 :edb/db-after-t 2194 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535506 50 #inst "2026-10-09T01:25:10.425Z" 13194139535506 true] [17592186092224 1020 #edb/ref 17592186352651 13194139535506 true] [17592186092225 1020 #edb/ref 17592186352642 13194139535506 true] [17592186092225 1020 #edb/ref 17592186352646 13194139535506 true] [17592186092226 1020 #edb/ref 17592186352635 13194139535506 true] [17592186092226 1020 #edb/ref 17592186352656 13194139535506 true] [17592186352635 1017 #edb/ref 17592186352636 13194139535506 true] [17592186352635 1089 "q-165483" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352635 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535506 true] [17592186352635 1100 "Calculate the asymptotes of the hyperbola \n${y}^{2}-25{x}^{2}-4y+50x-46=0.$" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352635 1113 #uuid "91c1c8c4-74ef-5df2-b862-509a3ca27ef4" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352635 1145 "To rewrite the equation of the hyperbola in standard form, we need to group the $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}-25{x}^{2}-4y+50x-46 & =0 \\\\ {y}^{2}-4y-25{x}^{2}+50x-46 & =0 \\\\ [{y}^{2}-4y]-25[{x}^{2}-2x]-46 & =0 \\\\ [(y-2)^{2}-4]-25[(x-1)^{2}-1]-46 & =0 \\\\ (y-2)^{2}-4-25(x-1)^{2}+25-46 & =0 \\\\ (y-2)^{2}-25(x-1)^{2} & =46+4-25 \\\\ (y-2)^{2}-25(x-1)^{2} & =25 \\\\ \\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{25}-(x-1)^{2} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe asymptotes of a vertical hyperbola\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1\n$$\n\nare given by \n\n$$\ny-k=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}(x-h).\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\n(h,k)=(1,2),\\,a=\\sqrt{25}=5,\\,b=\\sqrt{1}=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are\n\n$$\ny-2=\\pm 5(x-1).\n$$" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352636 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352637 13194139535506 true] [17592186352636 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352638 13194139535506 true] [17592186352636 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352639 13194139535506 true] [17592186352636 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352640 13194139535506 true] [17592186352636 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352641 13194139535506 true] [17592186352636 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535506 true] [17592186352636 1041 "selection" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352636 1104 #edb/ref 17592186352641 13194139535506 true] [17592186352636 1110 #uuid "023dd63b-1ad0-50d9-a4df-01e2d0577423" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352637 1034 "y-1=\\pm 5(x+1)" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352637 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535506 true] [17592186352637 1111 #uuid "9206aa7a-0fa2-5726-9a57-74c0b5a833f7" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352638 1034 "y-1=\\pm \\frac{1}{2}(x-1)" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352638 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535506 true] [17592186352638 1111 #uuid "00f9e819-0711-599f-b016-f041661a29dd" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352639 1034 "y-2=\\pm \\frac{1}{5}(x-2)" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352639 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535506 true] [17592186352639 1111 #uuid "98623e6a-2f74-59a5-9b92-382f760f9550" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352640 1034 "y+2=\\pm 2(x+1)" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352640 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535506 true] [17592186352640 1111 #uuid "00a0a2d0-1d35-5515-8b27-0ce97bee0627" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352641 1034 "y-2=\\pm 5(x-1)" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352641 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535506 true] [17592186352641 1111 #uuid "98fb6adf-2efa-5a13-b312-03192daac55c" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352642 1017 #edb/ref 17592186352643 13194139535506 true] [17592186352642 1089 "q-325365" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352642 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535506 true] [17592186352642 1100 "Calculate the asymptotes of the hyperbola $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{12}-\\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{27}=1.$\n\n$y=\\pm $\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352642 1113 #uuid "be726065-ce9d-5004-b5f1-84da122847df" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352642 1145 "The standard equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a vertical hyperbola, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny-k=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}(x-h).\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\n(h,k)=(-3,0),\\,a=\\sqrt{12}=2\\sqrt{3},\\,b=\\sqrt{27}=3\\sqrt{3}.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the asymptotes are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-0 & =\\pm (\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3\\sqrt{3}})(x-(-3)) \\\\ y & =\\pm \\,\\frac{2}{3}(x+3).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352643 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352644 13194139535506 true] [17592186352643 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352645 13194139535506 true] [17592186352643 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535506 true] [17592186352643 1041 "field-1" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352643 1104 #edb/ref 17592186352645 13194139535506 true] [17592186352643 1110 #uuid "32719783-0d02-5464-ba52-1c11f69ed8b5" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352644 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}(x+3)" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352644 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535506 true] [17592186352644 1111 #uuid "48c146d5-bc1a-55c8-8154-001b3bbd5d40" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352645 1034 "\\frac{2}{3}(x+3)" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352645 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535506 true] [17592186352645 1111 #uuid "b725303b-ffe0-56ca-bdb7-e5002785b3ea" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352646 1017 #edb/ref 17592186352647 13194139535506 true] [17592186352646 1017 #edb/ref 17592186352649 13194139535506 true] [17592186352646 1089 "q-325369" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352646 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535506 true] [17592186352646 1100 "Calculate the asymptotes of the hyperbola $\\frac{(y+4)^{2}}{8}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{18}=1.$\n\n$y\\,\\,+$\n{{field-1}}\n$=\\pm $\n{{field-2}}" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352646 1113 #uuid "ba94fa4e-99b5-5217-b9f3-8081f688e63d" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352646 1145 "The standard equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a vertical hyperbola, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny-k=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}(x-h).\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\n(h,k)=(0,-4),\\,a=\\sqrt{8}=2\\sqrt{2},\\,b=\\sqrt{18}=3\\sqrt{2}.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the asymptotes are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-(-4) & =\\pm (\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{3\\sqrt{2}})(x-0) \\\\ y+4 & =\\pm \\,\\frac{2}{3}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352647 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352648 13194139535506 true] [17592186352647 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535506 true] [17592186352647 1041 "field-1" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352647 1104 #edb/ref 17592186352648 13194139535506 true] [17592186352647 1110 #uuid "b381d918-9cf3-569b-9cb8-4eadf5c85e7e" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352648 1034 "4" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352648 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535506 true] [17592186352648 1111 #uuid "c8735dab-3e76-53bb-8a25-9fcd08c92350" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352649 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352650 13194139535506 true] [17592186352649 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535506 true] [17592186352649 1041 "field-2" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352649 1104 #edb/ref 17592186352650 13194139535506 true] [17592186352649 1110 #uuid "db02c27f-3f3d-5556-b5d7-bd493458efdf" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352650 1034 "\\frac{2}{3}x" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352650 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535506 true] [17592186352650 1111 #uuid "7334602b-ec91-5393-a858-4fd28a887add" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352651 1017 #edb/ref 17592186352652 13194139535506 true] [17592186352651 1017 #edb/ref 17592186352654 13194139535506 true] [17592186352651 1089 "q-325434" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352651 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535506 true] [17592186352651 1100 "Calculate the asymptotes of the hyperbola $25{x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}-150x-8y+121=0.$\n\n$y\\,\\,+$\n{{field-1}}\n$=\\pm $\n{{field-2}}" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352651 1113 #uuid "babf6353-821a-51d2-8a25-894755482c42" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352651 1145 "Group the $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}25{x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}-150x-8y+121 & =0 \\\\ 25({x}^{2}-6x)-4({y}^{2}+2y)+121 & =0 \\\\ 25\\,[(x-3)^{2}-9]-4\\,[(y+1)^{2}-1]+121 & =0 \\\\ 25(x-3)^{2}-225-4(y+1)^{2}+4+121 & =0 \\\\ 25(x-3)^{2}-4(y+1)^{2} & =100 \\\\ \\frac{25(x-3)^{2}}{100}-\\frac{4(y+1)^{2}}{100} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-3)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{(y+1)^{2}}{25} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus it is a horizontal hyperbola\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1,\n$$\n\nso the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny-k=\\pm \\frac{b}{a}(x-h).\n$$\n\nHere,\n\n$$\n(h,k)=(3,-1),\\,a=\\sqrt{4}=2,\\,b=\\sqrt{25}=5.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-(-1) & =\\pm (\\frac{5}{2})(x-3) \\\\ y+1 & =\\pm \\,\\frac{5}{2}(x-3).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352652 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352653 13194139535506 true] [17592186352652 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535506 true] [17592186352652 1041 "field-1" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352652 1104 #edb/ref 17592186352653 13194139535506 true] [17592186352652 1110 #uuid "4f238af1-6116-599d-8084-47e905e3f471" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352653 1034 "1" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352653 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535506 true] [17592186352653 1111 #uuid "b3044fdf-a534-5cef-b6f7-ba17f30e4826" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352654 1000 #edb/ref 17592186352655 13194139535506 true] [17592186352654 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535506 true] [17592186352654 1041 "field-2" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352654 1104 #edb/ref 17592186352655 13194139535506 true] [17592186352654 1110 #uuid "0674679d-1cda-50c6-abaf-5a8e0e5fe74a" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352655 1034 "\\frac{5}{2}(x-3)" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352655 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535506 true] [17592186352655 1111 #uuid "51baa54b-1f22-5d89-afc6-449000b9dda8" 13194139535506 true] [17592186352656 1017 #edb/ref 1759218635